export anchor DarkDocumentStyle:
    number: 266
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Dark document
    idea: The folder reads like a calm written page on warm charcoal, with a slim page tree on the left and the selected file opening as a callout inside the text.
    base: dark
    palette:
        charcoal: #191817, page, document and style sheet
        tree: #1f1e1c, the page tree
        ink: #e8e4dd, text and headings
        muted: #a9a297, meta sentences, tree labels and icons
        line: #34312d, dividers, dashed list rules and outlines
        tag: #2b2926, status tags, search and the current tree page
        callout: #24222f, the details callout
        lavender: #b8acf6, primary button, callout edge, upload meter, current tree icon and focus
        lavenderInk: #1b1733, text on lavender
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial. Base 16px at 1.7. The title is 36px at 700, section heads
        20px at 650, file links 16px at 500 underlined, meta sentences 14px
        muted, tags 13px, tree items 14px.
    layout:
        A 248px page tree holds the B mark and Brightwork Drive, a Places
        group with the five places, a My files group with Fernhill Studio
        open, Website redesign current and Brand assets and Wireframes
        nested on thin guide lines, then 64.2 GB of 100 GB used with a 4px
        bar. The right side has a slim top bar with the breadcrumb and a
        filled Search files field. Below sits a 760px reading column with
        a large folder icon, the title, the sentence A folder in Fernhill
        Studio with two folders and six files, and a row of Upload, New
        folder and a List or Grid switch. A Folders heading and a Files
        heading each hold lines of name, a sentence such as 4.2 MB,
        modified 27 Oct by Priya Nair, and tags. The selected file opens a
        callout under its line with the preview, owner, version, size,
        sharing and the three buttons. Below 860px the tree stacks on top
        and the callout goes full width.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 56px above the title, 36px before each section, 8px line padding, 20px callout padding.
    density: Calm. Each file is one sentence line and the selected file opens in place.
    corners: 6px buttons, fields and callout, 4px tags and tree items.
    borders: 1px #34312d dividers and dashed rules between lines. The callout has a 3px lavender left edge.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        18px line icons in muted warm grey. Tags carry a filled star with
        Starred, two heads with Shared with 4 people and an up arrow ring
        with Uploading, 62%, plus a 4px lavender bar.
    focus: A 2px lavender outline with a 2px offset and 4px rounding.
    tone: Written sentences, such as A folder in Fernhill Studio with two folders and six files.
